Absolutely, I think it would be worth sharing the insights with the other hospitals at the conference. By doing so, we’re not just supporting them in improving recovery times; we’re also contributing to the wider health community in a meaningful way.(){

To make this even more impactful, I suggest we go a step further and propose a collaborative workshop where we could discuss best practices and develop targeted recommendations tailored to individual needs. This way, we could involve HealthCorp in a more engaged dialogue, ensuring our best practices are integrated while still generating value for the others.

Additionally, I’d like to access our team’s data from previous collaborations to pull insights that could be shared as a united front, showing how shared knowledge has led to better health outcomes. This could further solidify our position as thought leaders in the industry post-conference, while still offering competitive advantages elsewhere without dampening them forlong term synergies.
